{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864890/extras/b4b686bf6beaab6f5db741ea449535c2.avif?t=1769068938\" width=750 height=65 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Next-gen lighting elevates retro 2.5D pixel art into cinematic medieval masterpieces. From storm-lashed towns to candlelit castles, the glint on knights' armor to the flicker of tavern hearths \u2014 every frame tells a grand saga. Total immersion awaits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864890/extras/c93d69942f6cd2794ea454a88a285615.poster.avif?t=1769068938\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864890/extras/c93d69942f6cd2794ea454a88a285615.webm?t=1769068938\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864890/extras/c93d69942f6cd2794ea454a88a285615.mp4?t=1769068938\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864890/extras/74c18ee3e93bb4650e9b453c23e2df51.poster.avif?t=1769068938\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864890/extras/74c18ee3e93bb4650e9b453c23e2df51.webm?t=1769068938\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864890/extras/74c18ee3e93bb4650e9b453c23e2df51.mp4?t=1769068938\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864890/extras/fe62e6a12853a4f10b7f03c2eeb366c4.avif?t=1769068938\" width=750 height=65 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every critical decision you make ripples through your companions' growth, convictions, and ultimate fates. Loyalty, betrayal, redemption... Your choices weave their legends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864890/extras/ab956e2ec2b4b53566c18f95a56d5295.avif?t=1769068938\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864890/extras/8c56e90d712596f569472bde46d244ab.avif?t=1769068938\" width=750 height=65 /></span>Forget mindless clicking! Deep class synergy, precise action order, and rich character traits forge intensely challenging and rewarding tactical combat. Every move demands cunning.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864890/extras/7ce03f08e3d0389375542b4bef0a814e.poster.avif?t=1769068938\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864890/extras/7ce03f08e3d0389375542b4bef0a814e.webm?t=1769068938\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864890/extras/7ce03f08e3d0389375542b4bef0a814e.mp4?t=1769068938\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864890/extras/34a26fe2505bb8ba5a08964c774162c5.poster.avif?t=1769068938\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864890/extras/34a26fe2505bb8ba5a08964c774162c5.webm?t=1769068938\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864890/extras/34a26fe2505bb8ba5a08964c774162c5.mp4?t=1769068938\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864890/extras/327759c92c8cb7c60f0b3018d2fc6520.avif?t=1769068938\" width=750 height=65 /></span>In a crumbling kingdom where ancient evils stir, your choices reshape the world's fate and the story's end. Become both witness and architect of legend.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864890/extras/088427f7dbfce1546e205d56b153a65a.poster.avif?t=1769068938\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864890/extras/088427f7dbfce1546e205d56b153a65a.webm?t=1769068938\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864890/extras/088427f7dbfce1546e205d56b153a65a.mp4?t=1769068938\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3864890?t=1769068938","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3864890?t=1769068938","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864890/de5ef8cf229915aa54277d8b974848c872143d7f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769068938","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864890/de5ef8cf229915aa54277d8b974848c872143d7f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769068938","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Official community</h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>&quot;</strong></i><strong>SPARK IGNITES<i>&quot;</i></strong><i> <strong>DEMO Experience Issues and BUG Feedback Group: 654124361</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864890/extras/553aabd94f6f990045e277c578d535dc.avif?t=1769068938\" width=616 height=154 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864890/extras/dcadc6017fdf76c9351212cf6af28682.avif?t=1769068938\" width=601 height=149 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The mobile version of QQ allows you to join a channel directly by scanning a QR code, while the desktop version of QQ lets you click the [Channel] button at the top of the interface or the [#] button on the left, then search for 'SPARK IGNITES' to join the channel.If you encounter a bug in the DEMO, you can join the group and report it to an administrator. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thank you for your cooperation!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864890/extras/b4b686bf6beaab6f5db741ea449535c2.avif?t=1769068938\" width=750 height=65 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Next-gen lighting elevates retro 2.5D pixel art into cinematic medieval masterpieces. From storm-lashed towns to candlelit castles, the glint on knights' armor to the flicker of tavern hearths \u2014 every frame tells a grand saga. Total immersion awaits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864890/extras/c93d69942f6cd2794ea454a88a285615.poster.avif?t=1769068938\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864890/extras/c93d69942f6cd2794ea454a88a285615.webm?t=1769068938\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864890/extras/c93d69942f6cd2794ea454a88a285615.mp4?t=1769068938\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864890/extras/74c18ee3e93bb4650e9b453c23e2df51.poster.avif?t=1769068938\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864890/extras/74c18ee3e93bb4650e9b453c23e2df51.webm?t=1769068938\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864890/extras/74c18ee3e93bb4650e9b453c23e2df51.mp4?t=1769068938\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864890/extras/fe62e6a12853a4f10b7f03c2eeb366c4.avif?t=1769068938\" width=750 height=65 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every critical decision you make ripples through your companions' growth, convictions, and ultimate fates. Loyalty, betrayal, redemption... Your choices weave their legends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864890/extras/ab956e2ec2b4b53566c18f95a56d5295.avif?t=1769068938\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864890/extras/8c56e90d712596f569472bde46d244ab.avif?t=1769068938\" width=750 height=65 /></span>Forget mindless clicking! Deep class synergy, precise action order, and rich character traits forge intensely challenging and rewarding tactical combat. Every move demands cunning.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864890/extras/7ce03f08e3d0389375542b4bef0a814e.poster.avif?t=1769068938\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864890/extras/7ce03f08e3d0389375542b4bef0a814e.webm?t=1769068938\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864890/extras/7ce03f08e3d0389375542b4bef0a814e.mp4?t=1769068938\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864890/extras/34a26fe2505bb8ba5a08964c774162c5.poster.avif?t=1769068938\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864890/extras/34a26fe2505bb8ba5a08964c774162c5.webm?t=1769068938\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864890/extras/34a26fe2505bb8ba5a08964c774162c5.mp4?t=1769068938\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864890/extras/327759c92c8cb7c60f0b3018d2fc6520.avif?t=1769068938\" width=750 height=65 /></span>In a crumbling kingdom where ancient evils stir, your choices reshape the world's fate and the story's end. Become both witness and architect of legend.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay mute